The second page of this app is to view a list of courses per term, 
and edit any fields about the course. This page had minimal changes to the final result.
Some changes that took place are: changed the layout of each course in the list of courses,
the status is now on top right instead of bottom, and due dates are listed right beneath the title,
this is a minor change and doesn't affect the usability of the app. Another minor change is the addition
of buttons that take the user to view and edit the term, this was done to help the user accomplish 
the desired task, whether editing or just viewing about the course.